      <strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href="tel:+264812455852">+264 81 245 5852</a></p>

      <h2 id="section-15">15. Governing Law</h2>

      <p>This Privacy Policy shall be interpreted in accordance with the applicable laws of the Republic of Namibia.</p>

